   "widgets_values": [
    "## WEB6b Upscale 2x (commercial, for shipped assets)\nRealESRGAN_x4plus, then halved back to 2x. Set the scale to 1.0 for a full 4x. ~13 s at 2 MP in.\n\n- **Licence: BSD-3-Clause**, commercial use OK. This is the upscaler for everything in `web/public/assets/generated/`.\n- The model lives in `artgen/models/upscale_models/` (project-only, via `extra_model_paths.yaml`). If the loader shows it missing, start ComfyUI with this project's launcher.\n- Hero at 2 MP (1936 px) becomes ~3870 px: enough for 1920 px at 2x DPR.\n- Textures from WEB5 stay seamless when upscaled."
   ]
  },
